{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.6, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.2, [TSON-SCHEMA] §8.3 (values by name, proposed as §5.12)"
  description: "Each segment is a name of the family of what it enters: orders is an interface, keyed by method_name, the kernel's identifier ([TSON-DATA] §7.7), which begins with no digit, so 1x selects no key and orders.1x is no name."
